# Redirect Rules for Netlify

https://abhinavranjan.netlify.app/* https://abhinavranjan.qzz.io/:splat 301!
http://abhinavranjan.qzz.io/* https://abhinavranjan.qzz.io/:splat 301!
https://www.abhinavranjan.qzz.io/* https://abhinavranjan.qzz.io/:splat 301!

# Serverless API — route /api/* to Netlify Functions
/api/*  /.netlify/functions/:splat  200

# Clean Blog Routing
/blogs               /frontend/blogs/index.html            200
/blogs/              /frontend/blogs/index.html            200
/blogs/:slug         /frontend/blogs/content/:slug.html    200

# Custom Error Pages
/offline /offline.html 200
/403     /403.html    403
/404     /404.html    404
/500     /500.html    500
